{"title": "Anti-drug activist shot dead by medical store owner in Punjab", "summary": "Anti-drug activist Parvinder Singh alias Jhota was shot dead by a medical store owner in Mansa, Punjab. The incident occurred when Jhota was questioning the owner about the sale of certain drugs and recording the argument on his mobile phone. The shooting was captured on camera, with some reports indicating it happened during a Facebook Live session. Jhota had been campaigning against drug abuse in the area and would often confront alleged drug peddlers, sometimes recording these altercations. The killing has led to a political reaction, with the opposition alleging a failure of the state government.", "summary_points": [], "title_hi": "पंजाब में दवा दुकान के मालिक ने नशीली दवाओं के कार्यकर्ता की गोली मारकर हत्या की", "summary_hi": "नशीली दवाओं के कार्यकर्ता परविंदर सिंह उर्फ ​​झोटा की पंजाब के मानसा में एक दवा दुकान के मालिक ने गोली मारकर हत्या कर दी। यह घटना तब हुई जब झोटा दुकान के मालिक से कुछ दवाओं की बिक्री के बारे में सवाल कर रहा था और अपने मोबाइल फोन पर बहस रिकॉर्ड कर रहा था। गोलीबारी कैमरे में कैद हो गई, कुछ रिपोर्टों में कहा गया है कि यह फेसबुक लाइव सत्र के दौरान हुआ। झोटा क्षेत्र में नशीली दवाओं के दुरुपयोग के खिलाफ अभियान चला रहा था और अक्सर कथित नशीली दवाओं के तस्करों का सामना करता था, कभी-कभी इन झड़पों को रिकॉर्ड करता था। इस हत्या ने राजनीतिक प्रतिक्रिया को जन्म दिया है, जिसमें विपक्ष ने राज्य सरकार की विफलता का आरोप लगाया है।", "summary_points_hi": [], "framing": {"left": ["The sole rated outlet on the left emphasized the activist questioning the store owner over drug sales and recording the argument."], "center": ["Coverage from the center highlighted that the shooting occurred during a Facebook Live session.", "Centrist reporting noted the activist's long-term campaign against drug abuse and his practice of confronting peddlers on camera."], "right": ["Right-leaning coverage framed the killing as sparking a political firestorm, with the opposition alleging the failure of the Mann government."]}, "framing_hi": {"left": ["बाएं ओर के एकमात्र रेटेड आउटलेट ने कार्यकर्ता द्वारा नशीली दवाओं की बिक्री पर स्टोर मालिक से सवाल करने और बहस रिकॉर्ड करने पर जोर दिया।"], "center": ["केंद्र से कवरेज ने इस बात पर प्रकाश डाला कि गोलीबारी फेसबुक लाइव सत्र के दौरान हुई।", "केंद्रवादी रिपोर्टिंग ने नशीली दवाओं के दुरुपयोग के खिलाफ कार्यकर्ता के दीर्घकालिक अभियान और कैमरे पर तस्करों का सामना करने की उनकी प्रथा को नोट किया।"], "right": ["दक्षिणपंथी कवरेज ने हत्या को एक राजनीतिक तूफान भड़काने के रूप में चित्रित किया, जिसमें विपक्ष ने मान सरकार की विफलता का आरोप लगाया।"]}, "topic": "Crime & Law", "region": "India", "published_at": null, "image_url": "https://images.indianexpress.com/2026/10/Untitled-design-2.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "The Indian Express", "owner": "Indian Express Group", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://indianexpress.com/article/cities/chandigarh/parwinder-jhota-drug-activist-medicine-shop-owner-shot-dead-on-camera-10919094", "headline": "Punjab drug activist confronts medicine shop owner, shot dead on camera"}, {"source": "NDTV", "owner": "NDTV", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.ndtv.com/india-news/parvinder-singh-jhota-anti-drug-activist-shot-dead-by-medical-store-owner-in-punjab-mansa-maar-mujhe-12177449", "headline": "\"Maar Mujhe\": Anti-Drug Activist Shot Dead By Medical Store Owner In Punjab"}, {"source": "The Hindu", "owner": "The Hindu Group", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/punjab/anti-drug-activist-shot-dead-by-medical-store-owner-in-punjabs-mansa/article71578338.ece", "headline": "Anti-drug activist shot dead by medical store owner in Punjab's Mansa"}, {"source": "Republic World", "owner": "Republic World", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Killing of Anti-Drug Activist Parminder Jhota in Punjab Sparks Political Firestorm, Opposition Alleges Failure of Mann Govt"}, {"source": "The